 * EPHEMERAL STAGING OVERLAY ONLY.
 *
 * This file is copied into a disposable Convex source tree, uploaded only to
 * Development deployment content-dog-757, executed once, and then removed by
 * re-uploading the base application tree. It must never live in convex/ in the
 * release worktree and must never remain in the deployed function manifest.
